' the look of the hexagon, read by PlantUML as its config before hexagon.puml: a ring is a package, seen by its
' title alone; a module a hexagon; a type a card with its role as the stereotype; the legend a frame
skinparam ranksep 24
skinparam nodesep 24
<style>
document { Shadowing 0 }
arrow { FontSize 10; FontColor #666666 }
package { HorizontalAlignment center; LineColor transparent; BackgroundColor transparent }
hexagon { HorizontalAlignment center; FontStyle plain }
rectangle { LineColor transparent; BackgroundColor transparent }
card { stereotype { FontSize 10; FontStyle plain } }
frame { FontSize 10; FontColor #666666; LineColor #BBBBBB }
</style>
